    {"type": "cause", "text": "The FY2025 operating margin rose 7.5pp, with 6.2pp from other lines, 0.7pp from SG&A and 0.6pp from cost of revenue [D463][D477][D476][D475]."},
    {"type": "cause", "text": "The other-line swing reflects lower other operating charges after the prior-year fairlife remeasurement, while SG&A fell on lower Foundation contributions and incentive expense [P12][P13]."},
