  ]},
  {"key": "cash", "title": "Cash conversion", "sentences": [
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Operating cash flow of $7.4 billion and free cash flow of $5.3 billion were 15.5% and 11.0% of revenue in FY2025 [F100][F120][D434][D433]."},
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Free cash flow covered only 0.40x of net income, the window low against a 0.97x median, and ranked 0th percentile versus staples peers [D437][D776][D778][D795]."},
    {"type": "cause", "text": "FY2024's collapse to $6.8 billion operating cash flow came from a $6.0 billion IRS tax litigation deposit and refranchising effects [F99][P22]."},
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Capex of $2.1 billion was 4.4% of revenue and 2.01x D&A, the highest multiple in the window [F110][D432][D438]."}
