    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Buybacks plus dividends of $9.5 billion were 179.9% of free cash flow, the third straight year above 100% [D444][D445]."},
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Diluted shares fell only 0.2% in FY2025, so per-share growth tracked net income growth rather than buyback accretion [D468][D453][D451]."}
